## Who We Are

Xi'an Qiyun Zhixun Electronic Technology Co., Ltd. was founded in October 2018 in the Xi'an High-Tech Zone. We are an R&D-driven technical services company specializing in **one-stop custom development of embedded boards and electronic products**.

- **Team**: 30+ employees; core team with 10+ years of average industry experience
- **Certifications**: National High-Tech Enterprise, Sci-Tech SME, ISO9001 Quality Management System Certification
- **University partnerships**: Strategic partnerships with Xi'an Jiaotong University, Xidian University, and Northwestern Polytechnical University
- **Technical expertise**: Deep accumulation in five business areas — image processing, information processing, power management, voltage monitoring, and traction control

