## What We Do: One-Stop Hardware Development

From **idea to finished product**, one team handles the entire chain:

![One-stop hardware development flow](./assets/service-flow.svg)

```
Requirements Analysis → Schematic Design → PCB Design → PCB Fabrication → Component Sourcing → SMT Assembly → Firmware Development & Debug → Delivery
```

You can also engage us for any single stage — PCB design, component sourcing, or SMT assembly — with the same quality standards.

### Benefits of the One-Stop Model

| Benefit | Description |
| --- | --- |
| **Lower coordination cost** | One team end-to-end; no finger-pointing or information gaps between multiple vendors |
| **Controlled quality** | Standardized process management, consistent quality from design to delivery |
| **Shorter cycle** | Seamless handoff between design and production, faster time to market |
| **Better cost** | Unified supply chain management, fewer intermediary markups |

