## Flagship Cases

- **4K/8K multi-screen video stitching processor**: Built on Xilinx FPGA; supports 16 video inputs with sub-1-frame processing latency; widely deployed in command & dispatch centers
- **Professional AV conversion and streaming devices**: SDI/HDMI format converters, 4K live-streaming encoders, 32-channel digital audio processors for broadcast and conference systems
- **RK3588 edge computing platform**: Three form factors (SOM core board, compute board, complete unit) across 9 products; 8K video decode and -40~85°C wide-temperature operation
- **Railway train control electronics**: Companion boards for GYK / LKJ train control equipment, meeting high-reliability requirements of rail transit
- **Industrial vision processing modules**: Built on Zynq SoC; supports GigE Vision protocol and AI inference acceleration

In **rail transit** and **audio/video processing**, we have mature volume-production solutions that can be quickly customized and delivered.

